{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f36f5ae0-a76f-8c5b-baba-13e2fc42ea6f",
  "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:02:17-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Raj Okafor",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Luis Barros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T11:59:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance department, this is Luis. Happy Tuesday, almost lunchtime. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T11:59:25-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, sorry, I know this is silly, but I think I got a property tax bill I shouldn't have gotten. Can you hear me okay? I'm on my cell and it's not great in here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T11:59:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine so far. Tell me what's going on with the bill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T11:59:43-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, so my mortgage company is supposed to pay the taxes out of escrow. That's the whole point of the escrow. But a bill came in the mail anyway, with my name on it, and now I'm not sure if it's been paid or not."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T11:59:58-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That happens more than you'd think. Sometimes the bill goes to the owner even when the lender pays it. Do you have the bill in front of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:00:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, no, I'm at work. I [line breaks up] it's on my kitchen table. I didn't bring it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:00:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You cut out a little there. Say that last part again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:00:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry. I said the bill is at home, on the kitchen table. I don't have the account number with me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:00:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right. I can look it up by your name. What's the name on the account?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:00:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Raj Okafor. O-K-A-F-O-R. Sorry, it gets misspelled a lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:00:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okafor, got it. Give me a second here. [pause] Okay, I've got you. I can see the account. Let me check the status on this installment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:00:45-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, take your time. [crosstalk] Sorry, one second. My coworker is waving at me, we're doing the lunch orders and I'm the one who has to call them in. I'll be quick."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:00:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No rush, I'm not going anywhere. Lunch is serious business."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:01:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry about that. So, is it showing paid?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:01:03-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "What I'm seeing is that the lender's payment hasn't posted yet on this one. Those often land a bit after the bills go out, so it may just be a timing thing. I'd check with your mortgage company that they've sent it, but nothing here looks past due."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:01:19-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Sorry, I know that's probably obvious. Could you mail me a duplicate of the bill, though? Just so I have a clean copy, since mine's all marked up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:01:29-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can do that. Is it the same mailing address as what's on the account?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:01:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, same one. Nothing's changed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:01:38-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then it'll go out to that address. Give it several business days to show up. If you want, leave a callback number in case I need to reach you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:01:48-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Sorry, it's 401-555-0169."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:01:50-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0169. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:01:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. [line breaks up] sorry, I think I lost you for a second. Did you say several days?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:01:59-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Several business days, yes. And if the lender's payment still isn't showing after that, give us a call back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:02:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I will. Thank you, sorry for the trouble."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:02:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No trouble at all. Enjoy your lunch, whatever you end up ordering."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T12:02:15-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye now."
    }
  ],
